OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Leonard
OL,6,G     Bernstein
OL,7,     F5/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,8,     Ffinal years in the life of Leonard
OL,9,     FBernstein, when his behaviour
OL,10,     Fbecame more erratic, but he also
OL,11,     Fbecame more active in his work for
OL,12,     Fcharitable causes.
OL,13,G1700 In Tune
OL,14,     FMatthew Barley and Mishka Rushdie
OL,15,     FMomen play live. Ellie Neate on
OL,16,     FThe Marriage of Figaro.
OL,17,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,18,     FHalf and hour of back to back
OL,19,     Fclassical music, including works
OL,20,     Fby Esenvalds, Rachmaninov, Pauline
OL,21,     FHall, and Grace Williams.
